{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15017","headline":"宿定陵寺 · 卢纶","name":"宿定陵寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古塔荒台出禁墙，磬声初尽漏声长。\n云生紫殿幡花湿，月照青山松栢香。\n禅室夜闻风过竹，奠筵朝啓露沾裳。\n谁悟威灵同寂灭，更堪砧杵发昭阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}